  "screenTuplesByClass": {
    "_comment": "Really-shipped (width, height, dpr) combos. colorDepth is essentially always 24 (or 30 on some HDR macs). A tuple outside these for the class is a V1/V2 tell (rule R-SCREEN-REAL). Representative common modes.",
